{
  "info": {
    "name": "Gaming Library - Herd HTTP demo",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Start Herd en voer scripts/setup-herd.ps1 uit. Registreer een GEWOON gebruikersaccount in de browser. Vul email en password alleen lokaal in deze collectie in. Gebruik Postman Desktop en voer requests 01-15 op volgorde uit. Begin zonder bestaande Postman-sessie (verwijder zo nodig cookies voor gaming-library.test). Cookies en CSRF blijven ingeschakeld. Login/logout geven 302; productroutes geven JSON bij Accept: application/json. PATCH en PUT vereisen hier alle vijf productvelden. De demo verwijdert uitsluitend het product dat hij zelf heeft aangemaakt. Stop bij een onverwachte status; de Runner wordt dan automatisch gestopt. Exporteer of commit geen collectie met ingevulde wachtwoorden."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://gaming-library.test",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "email",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "csrf",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "demo_title",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 GET login + CSRF-token",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "text/html"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/login"
      },
      "protocolProfileBehavior": {
        "followRedirects": false
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
              "if (pm.response.code !== 200) { pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); throw new Error(\"Onverwachte HTTP-status: \" + pm.response.code); }",
              "const token = pm.response.text().match(/name=\"_token\"[^>]*value=\"([^\"]+)\"/);",
              "pm.test(\"CSRF-token aanwezig\", () => pm.expect(token).not.to.equal(null));",
              "if (!token) { pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); throw new Error(\"Geen CSRF-token. Controleer login en cookies.\"); }",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"csrf\", token[1]);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 POST inloggen (normale redirect)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          {
            "key": "Accept",
            "value": "application/json"
          },
          {
            "key": "X-CSRF-TOKEN",
            "value": "{{csrf}}"
          },
          {
            "key": "Content-Type",
            "value": "application/json"
          }
        ],
        "url": "{{base_url}}/login",
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}",
          "options": {
            "raw": {
              "language": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "protocolProfileBehavior": {
        "followRedirects": false
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"HTTP 302\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(302));",
              "if (pm.response.code !== 302) { pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); throw new Error(\"Onverwachte HTTP-status: \" + pm.response.code); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
